1
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,610
Tinku! Wake up! I kept the golden key safe all night!

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,165
Yawn... Pinky, it's Sunday morning!

3
00:00:15,215 --> 00:00:18,745
Exactly! No school today. Secret level time!

4
00:00:18,795 --> 00:00:19,745
Woof! Woof!

5
00:00:19,795 --> 00:00:22,640
Okay, okay! Moti wants to come too.

6
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:24,895
Where did you hide the key all night?

7
00:00:24,945 --> 00:00:27,865
Under my pillow! I checked it ten times!

8
00:00:27,915 --> 00:00:30,960
Key goes in the console... and... turn!

9
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,170
Here we go again!

10
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:38,295
Wow! We're on an island floating in the clouds!

11
00:00:38,345 --> 00:00:41,390
And there's a treasure chest on that far island!

12
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:44,505
But there's no bridge. How do we get across?

13
00:00:44,555 --> 00:00:47,395
Look, seven coloured tiles on the ground.

14
00:00:47,445 --> 00:00:50,550
Red, yellow, blue, green... they're all mixed up.

15
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:51,420
Woof!

16
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:55,005
Oops! Moti jumped on green first. Wrong tile!

17
00:00:55,055 --> 00:00:58,190
The tiles are shaking! Moti, come back!

18
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:01,210
Wait! I know this pattern. It's a rainbow!

19
00:01:01,610 --> 00:01:04,100
Red... orange... yellow...

20
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:07,285
Green... blue... indigo... violet!

21
00:01:07,335 --> 00:01:10,455
Look! Every jump builds a piece of the bridge!

22
00:01:10,505 --> 00:01:12,865
Pinky, how did you know the order?

23
00:01:12,915 --> 00:01:17,180
Mummy taught me. A rainbow always goes from red to violet!

24
00:01:17,380 --> 00:01:20,295
A rainbow bridge! Come on, let's cross!

25
00:01:21,095 --> 00:01:24,505
Ooh, it's a bit wobbly! Hold my hand, Tinku.

26
00:01:24,705 --> 00:01:27,770
Don't look down, Moti. Just look at the treasure!

27
00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:28,640
Woof!

28
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:32,730
We made it! Tinku, you open it.

29
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:36,215
No, Pinky. You solved the puzzle. You open it!

30
00:01:36,265 --> 00:01:38,885
Okay! One... two... three!

31
00:01:40,485 --> 00:01:44,000
Wow! A golden trophy! It says... BEST TEAM!

32
00:01:44,050 --> 00:01:47,200
And fireworks! The whole sky is sparkling!

33
00:01:47,250 --> 00:01:50,255
There's a note too: Thanks for playing, friends!

34
00:01:50,305 --> 00:01:51,835
Woof! Woof! Woof!

35
00:01:51,885 --> 00:01:54,670
Game complete! We finished the whole game!

36
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:57,255
Golu is going to love this trophy!

37
00:01:57,305 --> 00:01:59,645
Let's take it home and show him!

38
00:02:01,245 --> 00:02:04,520
Home sweet home! Hey, the trophy came with us!

39
00:02:04,570 --> 00:02:09,190
Next time: Golu's sneeze is so giant, everything flies away!

40
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,650
Bye-bye, friends!

41
00:02:10,700 --> 00:02:11,520
Woof!
